^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
Fixed 2026-07-22: thunks in virtually-inheriting hierarchies now use
the flat full-object pointer convention matching make_ptr_typecast,
and libstdc++'s library-defined locale/ios_base members are modeled
(locale ctors/dtor, ios_base::_M_init, locale::id::_M_id,
__try_use_facet null for unmodeled facets).  See also
cpp11_virtual_base_diamond_dtor for the header-free layout guard.
